Package: cred
Title: Citation Review and Evidence Documentation
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-08-31
Authors@R:
    person("Al", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for extracting, auditing, and verifying inline citations
    in bookdown R Markdown documents. Supports systematic detection of
    hallucinated statistics or misattributed findings introduced during
    LLM-assisted drafting.
